{
  "engine": "blueprint",
  "id": 42,
  "title": {
    "cs": "Proč je led kluzký",
    "en": "Why ice is slippery",
    "ro": "De ce gheața e alunecoasă"
  },
  "description": {
    "cs": "Učili tě, že brusle taví led tlakem? To je mýtus. Tady je skutečnost. 🧊⛸️",
    "en": "Were you taught skates melt ice with pressure? That's a myth. Here's the real story. 🧊⛸️",
    "ro": "Ai învățat că patinele topesc gheața prin presiune? E un mit. Iată adevărul. 🧊⛸️"
  },
  "hashtags": [
    "fyzika",
    "physics",
    "science",
    "led",
    "brusleni",
    "ice"
  ],
  "scenes": [
    {
      "narration": {
        "cs": "Proč je led kluzký? Školní vysvětlení je *špatně*.",
        "en": "Why is ice slippery? The school answer is *wrong*.",
        "ro": "De ce e gheața alunecoasă? Răspunsul de la școală e *greșit*."
      },
      "headline": {
        "cs": "ŠKOLA SE|MÝLILA",
        "en": "SCHOOL|GOT IT WRONG",
        "ro": "ȘCOALA|A GREȘIT"
      },
      "tag": "MYTH ALERT",
      "accent": "red",
      "visual": {
        "type": "icon",
        "icon": "ice",
        "icon2": null,
        "relation": "none",
        "effect": "shake",
        "caption": null
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": {
        "cs": "Říká se, že brusle led roztaví *tlakem*.",
        "en": "They say skates melt the ice with *pressure*.",
        "ro": "Se spune că patinele topesc gheața prin *presiune*."
      },
      "headline": {
        "cs": "MÝTUS:|TLAK",
        "en": "MYTH:|PRESSURE",
        "ro": "MIT:|PRESIUNEA"
      },
      "tag": "PRESSURE MELTING",
      "accent": "red",
      "visual": {
        "type": "forces",
        "body": "skate",
        "arrows": [
          {
            "dir": "down",
            "size": 2.5,
            "label": {
              "cs": "tlak",
              "en": "pressure",
              "ro": "presiune"
            },
            "color": "red"
          }
        ],
        "motion": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": {
        "cs": "Jenže tlak sníží bod tání jen o *zlomek stupně*.",
        "en": "But pressure lowers the melting point by just *a fraction of a degree*.",
        "ro": "Dar presiunea scade punctul de topire doar cu *o fracțiune de grad*."
      },
      "headline": {
        "cs": "JEN ZLOMEK|STUPNĚ",
        "en": "JUST A|FRACTION",
        "ro": "DOAR O|FRACȚIUNE"
      },
      "tag": "CLAUSIUS–CLAPEYRON",
      "accent": "yellow",
      "visual": {
        "type": "bars",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "cs": "potřeba",
              "en": "needed",
              "ro": "necesar"
            },
            "value": 10,
            "highlight": true
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "cs": "tlak brusle",
              "en": "skate pressure",
              "ro": "presiunea patinei"
            },
            "value": 0.3,
            "highlight": false
          }
        ],
        "unit": {
          "cs": " °C",
          "en": " °C",
          "ro": " °C"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": {
        "cs": "Led je kluzký i při *mínus třiceti*, kde to nevysvětlí.",
        "en": "Ice is slippery even at *minus thirty*, which that can't explain.",
        "ro": "Gheața alunecă și la *minus treizeci*, ceea ce asta nu explică."
      },
      "headline": {
        "cs": "KLUŽE I|PŘI −30 °C",
        "en": "SLIPPERY|AT −30 °C",
        "ro": "ALUNECĂ|LA −30 °C"
      },
      "tag": "COUNTER-EXAMPLE",
      "accent": "blue",
      "visual": {
        "type": "counter",
        "from": 0,
        "to": -30,
        "decimals": 0,
        "unit": {
          "cs": " °C",
          "en": " °C",
          "ro": " °C"
        },
        "caption": {
          "cs": "a pořád to klouže",
          "en": "and it's still slippery",
          "ro": "și tot alunecă"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": {
        "cs": "Na povrchu ledu jsou molekuly vázané jen *napůl*.",
        "en": "At the surface, ice molecules are only *half-bonded*.",
        "ro": "La suprafață, moleculele de gheață sunt legate doar *pe jumătate*."
      },
      "headline": {
        "cs": "VOLNÉ|MOLEKULY",
        "en": "LOOSE|MOLECULES",
        "ro": "MOLECULE|LIBERE"
      },
      "tag": "SURFACE LAYER",
      "accent": "teal",
      "visual": {
        "type": "particles",
        "mode": "solid",
        "label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": {
        "cs": "Tvoří tenkou vrstvičku, která se chová skoro *jako voda*.",
        "en": "They form a thin layer that behaves almost *like water*.",
        "ro": "Formează un strat subțire care se comportă aproape *ca apa*."
      },
      "headline": {
        "cs": "SKORO|VODA",
        "en": "ALMOST|WATER",
        "ro": "APROAPE|APĂ"
      },
      "tag": "QUASI-LIQUID LAYER",
      "accent": "blue",
      "visual": {
        "type": "particles",
        "mode": "liquid",
        "label": null
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": {
        "cs": "A tření při klouzání přidá ještě trochu *tepla*.",
        "en": "And friction while sliding adds a little *heat* on top.",
        "ro": "Iar frecarea la alunecare adaugă puțină *căldură*."
      },
      "headline": {
        "cs": "TŘENÍ|OHŘÍVÁ",
        "en": "FRICTION|HEATS",
        "ro": "FRECAREA|ÎNCĂLZEȘTE"
      },
      "tag": "FRICTIONAL HEATING",
      "accent": "red",
      "visual": {
        "type": "steps",
        "items": [
          {
            "cs": "volná povrchová vrstva",
            "en": "loose surface layer",
            "ro": "strat liber la suprafață"
          },
          {
            "cs": "teplo z tření",
            "en": "heat from friction",
            "ro": "căldură din frecare"
          },
          {
            "cs": "tenký film vody",
            "en": "a thin water film",
            "ro": "o peliculă de apă"
          }
